# ⚠ DEVELOPMENT ROOT KEY — PUBLIC BY CONSTRUCTION ⚠
#
# This is the private half of the `dev-root-2026a` keypair whose public half is
# pinned in `src/rootkeys.ts`. It lives in a public repository, so any trust
# document it signs is signed by a key everyone on earth already has.
#
# It exists so the plugin suites can build real signed trust documents and drive
# step 0 of the loader end to end. It MUST NEVER sign a published document, and
# `npm run release-keys` refuses to publish while `dev-root-2026a` is pinned —
# the operator's ceremony (design §1.4c) replaces that record with root-2026a
# and root-2026b, generated offline and stored in two vaults.
#
# PEM parsers ignore everything before the BEGIN line, so this header costs
# nothing at read time.
-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----
MC4CAQAwBQYDK2VwBCIEIF+rwnKmeTaR00+rMbpGXbCFRI2ZWA8RlJEeGJeGtgPv
-----END PRIVATE KEY-----
